  "job_B2.3.6_20251003_114508": {
    "text": "Leofan men, ic wille eow nu cy\u00f0an ymbe cyricm\u00e6rsunge, \u00fe\u00e6t ge \u00fee geornor understandan magan hu\nOn ealddagum w\u00e6s an hus ar\u00e6red Gode \u00e6lmihtigum to lofe binnan \u00fe\u00e6re byrig Gerusalem, & \u00fe\u00e6t ar\u00e6rde\nAnd se Salomon \u00feeah swy\u00f0e wel ealswa him gecynde w\u00e6s, & ongann sona on his geogo\u00f0e God lufian\nGod \u00e6lmihtig him geu\u00f0e swa micles wisdomes \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fre \u00e6nig ne wear\u00f0 \u00e6r \u00f0am eor\u00f0lice man wisra\nAnd he wes se forma man \u00fee Gode to lofe \u00e6rest on eor\u00f0an templgeweorc ar\u00e6rde.\nHis f\u00e6der Dauid cyning hit h\u00e6fde gemynt \u00e6r to donne, ac he ne gefor\u00f0ede hit na, ac hit wear\u00f0 \u00feurh his\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6reste hus \u00fee on eor\u00f0an geworht wurde.\nAnd \u00fea \u00fea hit gearo wear\u00f0, \u00fea gesomnade se cyng ealle his witan to \u00f0\u00e6re halgunge, & hit \u00fea m\u00e6rlicost\nAnd eal \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6rto gesamnod w\u00e6s w\u00e6s on mycelre myrh\u00f0e & on fulre gesibsumnesse; & on\nAnd \u00fea \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t se m\u00e6ra cyning Gode & Godes folce \u00fe\u00e6t hus to gebedhuse bet\u00e6hte, \u00fea w\u00e6s he\n\u00d0onne do we ealswa \u00feonne we cyrican halgia\u00f0.\nGode we hy bet\u00e6ca\u00f0 to \u00f0am \u00feingum \u00fe\u00e6t cristene menn \u00fe\u00e6rto faran magan & \u00fe\u00e6r heora neode to Gode\nWitodlice \u00e6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00fee cyrican rihtlice sec\u00f0 & mid cl\u00e6num mode \u00fe\u00e6r to Gode clypa\u00f0 & his \u00feearfe\nAc man ah micle \u00feearfe \u00feeh \u00fe\u00e6t hy man swa sece swa swa \u00fe\u00e6rto gebyre\u00f0; \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t hy man sece mid\nAnd so\u00f0lice swa oft swa men cyrican seca\u00f0, gode englas of heofenum locia\u00f0 georne on hwylce wisan\nAnd se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t his \u00feearfa beo\u00f0, se geglada\u00f0 God & his englas.\nAnd se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r de\u00f0 \u00e6nig unnyt wordes o\u00f0\u00f0on weorces, he dryh\u00f0 deofles willan & abelh\u00f0 his Drihtne\nNe gebyre\u00f0 \u00e6t cyrican \u00e6nig \u00feing to donne butan God to herianne & hine to gebiddanne.\nWa \u00feam \u00feonne witodlice \u00fee cyrican oftost mid idele seca\u00f0; \u00fe\u00e6t syndan \u00fea unges\u00e6ligan \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6r fleardia\u00f0\n\u00d0\u00e6r man s\u00e6c\u00f0 foroft swy\u00f0e ymbe fela \u00feinga; & \u00fe\u00e6r ne gebyrede \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6nig man sace gehyrde.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6r man waca\u00f0 ealles to oft swy\u00f0or on unnyt \u00feonne man sceolde.\nAnd micle betere is \u00e6lcum cristenum men \u00fe\u00e6t he nane w\u00e6ccan \u00e6t cyrican n\u00e6bbe \u00feonne he \u00fe\u00e6r wacige\nAc se \u00fee rihtlice his w\u00e6ccan healdan wille, fare \u00fe\u00e6rto mid Godes ege & bringe his \u00e6lmessan & wacie\nAnd witodlice nah man on \u00e6nigne timan ne d\u00e6ges ne nihtes \u00e6t Godes huse unnyt to donne.\nGif hit hwa \u00feonne \u00e6r \u00feissum dyde, geswice heonanfor\u00f0 georne; for\u00f0am sy\u00f0\u00f0an cyrice gehalgod bi\u00f0 &\nLeofan men, se eor\u00f0lica cyning Salomon getacna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne heofenlican cyning, \u00fe\u00e6t is, Crist sylfne; & \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd ealle Godes cyrican syn getealde \u00e6fter gastlicum andgyte to anre cyrican, & seo is ecclesia\nAnd so\u00fe is \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge, miclum freme\u00f0 se him sylfum \u00fee Gode to lofe cyrcan gegearwa\u00f0.\nAnd ealra getimbra huru is Gode gecwemast \u00fe\u00e6t se man hine sylfne getimbrige to \u00f0am \u00feingum \u00fe\u00e6t he\nAnd of \u00feam timan \u00e6rest \u00fee se man fulluht underfeh\u00f0, him wuna\u00f0 on se Halga Gast, gif he hine sylfne\nAnd gif he \u00feonne \u00feurh deofles lare hine sylfne wi\u00f0 God forsynga\u00f0 & leahtras lufa\u00f0, \u00feonne forl\u00e6t se\n\u00d0onne is micel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t manna gehwylc wi\u00f0 swylc w\u00e6r sy & his agen hus wel behweorfe; \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t\nSe gegearwa\u00f0 Gode licwyr\u00f0e hus on him sylfum se \u00fee anr\u00e6dlice & rihtlice God lufa\u00f0, & se hine lufa\u00f0\nLeofan men, \u00f0a lac \u00fee Salomon cyning geofrode Gode \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan cyrichalgunge, \u00fea getacnedan \u00fea\nEac manna gehwylc m\u00e6g be his m\u00e6\u00f0e mid \u00feam lacum \u00fee he elles h\u00e6f\u00f0 & \u00fee he \u00feurhteon m\u00e6g Gode\nAc be \u00feam he hy leana\u00f0 \u00fee he hy on \u00f0\u00e6s mannes heortan gesceawa\u00f0, ealswa he hwilum be sumre\nHit is swy\u00f0e rihtlic & swy\u00f0e micel nyd\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc cristen man swy\u00f0e gelome cyrican sece & \u00fe\u00e6r\nAnd swi\u00f0e micel \u00feearf is eac \u00fe\u00e6t cristene men \u00fe\u00e6ne egesan \u00e6fre ne dreogan \u00fe\u00e6t hy deofolgyld ahwar\nLeofan men, \u00f0\u00e6t folc \u00fee to Salomones cyrichalgunge gesomnod w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r wunode \u00fea hwile \u00fee hit \u00fe\u00e6r\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t folc getacnode ealle \u00fea cristenan men \u00fee nu ofer ealne middaneard cyrican seca\u00f0.\nAnd ealswa hy \u00fe\u00e6r on blisse w\u00e6ron \u00fea hwile \u00fee hy \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron, swa scylan cristene men eac mid\nAc se \u00f0e \u00feyder mid cl\u00e6num mode f\u00e6r\u00f0 & \u00fe\u00e6r bli\u00f0e bi\u00f0 for godcundre \u00feearfe & to Gode georne \u00feenc\u00f0\nLeofan men, ealle cyrican belimpa\u00f0 to anre, ealswa we \u00e6r cwedan, for\u00f0am ealle cristene men\nAnd \u00feonne se dom cym\u00f0, \u00feonne weor\u00f0a\u00f0 ealle men gesomnode to anum Godes dome, & halige men\nDon we nu eac georne swa swa us \u00feearf is, secan we gelome \u00fea cyrican \u00fee we nu lichamlice gesecan\nAnd utan a fulne hiht & f\u00e6str\u00e6dne geleafan habban on urne Drihten, for\u00f0am ne bi\u00f0 hit naht beo \u00f0\u00e6r\nAc an riht geleafa is georne to healdanne, \u00fe\u00e6t is, on \u00e6nne so\u00f0ne Godd \u00fee ealle \u00feing gesceop &\nAnd an fulluht is eallum cristenum mannum gem\u00e6ne, & \u00fe\u00e6t mot ure gehwylc rihtlice healdan gif we\n\u00d0onne is \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t forme bebod, \u00fe\u00e6t man lufie God ealmihtigne \u00e6fre ofer ealle o\u00f0re \u00feing, & sy\u00f0\u00f0an\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is swi\u00f0e rihtlic & \u00feearflic dom & Gode gecweme, & se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6ne dom gehealde\u00f0, he geearna\u00f0",
